      "text": "[7:15PM] #OguduAlapere #TrafficUpdate \n\nSlow and steady movement from Gbagada Bridge and Olopomeji down to Ifako, due to ongoing repairs to the damaged expansion joint at Ifako Bridge.\nGood traffic flow from Ifako connecting to Ogudu, NNPC Filling Station, and down to Ojota Bridge.\nSteady movement on Ojota Bridge connecting to Iyana Ikosi, although bus stop activities are causing some delays.\nSmooth traffic conditions from Ikosi Junction en route to Tollgate, down to Secretariat, and all the way to Otedola and Berger.\n\nGood return journey from Otedola connecting to Tollgate, down to Alapere, and all the way to Carwash inward Island, with a smooth drive.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
