      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1933592261347963142",
      "text": "[7:20PM] #Agege #TrafficUpdate \n\nBusy movement from Fumec inward Acme Junction down to Metal Box, due to evening rush hour congestion.\nHeavy traffic on Oba Akran from Dangote U-turn inward Mobil Ashade down to Akilo, also attributed to evening rush.\nCongested roads on Ijaye Road in and out of Odo Eran connecting to Oba Ogunji, due to influx of vehicles.\n\nFast-moving traffic on Guinness inward to Akanni Doherty, although slowing down approaching Mangoro Ashade due to traffic light alternation.\nBusy traffic on Capitol inward to Oniwaya Junction, with better movement inward Alfa Nla.\nCongested stretch on Old Ipaja Road from Okekoto inward Shofunde, while the stretch connecting Agbotikuyo down to NYSC is moving at a fast pace.\nHeavy traffic on Old Abeokuta Road from Isokoko inward Total underneath the bridge, due to traffic alternation and commuter activity, with minor delays at Abattoir.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
