      "text": "[7:27PM] #Badagry #TrafficUpdate \n\nSlightly busy movement from Custom Check Point inward Badagry down to Morogbo Bus Stop, due to evening traffic.\nGood traffic flow from Morogbo down to Odofa, and further extending to Church Gate, Ibiye, Magbon, and down to Okoafo.\nSmooth movement from Okoafo en route Elijah, Atura, Mowo, Aradagun, and down to Badagry Roundabout.\n\nGood return journey from Badagry Roundabout back to Agbara Custom Check Point.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
