      "text": "[7:41PM] #Ojo #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from Agbara Customs Checkpoint down to Tipper Garage.\nMoving traffic at Iyana Era Junction, with steady movement resuming after the junction inward Iyana Isashi down to Afromedia.\nGood traffic flow from Afromedia connecting to Iyana Iba inward to Volks.\nFast-moving traffic ascending Iyana Iba Flyover inward Mile 2, with smooth movement underneath the flyover inward to Igando.\nSteady movement from Volks down to Abule Osun, although traffic is moving at a slower pace at Trade Fair on both the main carriageway and service lane, as well as at Abule Ado.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
