      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1933607434272321593",
      "text": "[8:23PM] #Maryland_Ikeja #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood traffic flow on both sides of the service lane along Anthony Road, inward to Maryland Intersection, en route to Odo'yalaro, and Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward Customs.\nSlightly busy but moving traffic from Customs inward to Ikeja.\nFree-flowing traffic on Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way inward to Maryland.\nSlightly busy but moving traffic from Lasuth underneath the bridge inward to Kodesoh Road, while traffic from Kodesoh inward Lasuth underneath the bridge is good.\nGood traffic conditions on Oba Akinjobi Ikeja GRA and in and out of Mobolaji Bank Anthony Way.\nSmooth traffic flow on Oba Akran Link Bridge and Airport Link Bridge.\n\nOur officers are actively managing traffic to ensure a safe and orderly flow.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
