      "text": "[8:45PM] #Idumota #TrafficUpdate \n\nGood movement from underneath Idumota Bridge inward Eyin Eyo, connecting Balogun Street.\nSmooth traffic flow from Tinubu Square connecting Nnamdi Azikiwe Street, en route Tom Jones Intersection.\nGood traffic conditions around Oyebanji Roundabout, connecting Adeniji Adele Road, through Oba's Palace, and Police Post.\nFast-moving traffic on Illubirin connecting Carter Bridge, inward Ijora Olopa, as well as Oyingbo.\nGood traffic flow on Carter Bridge descending to Ebute Ero, connecting Leventis.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
